  "prefLabel": "Ins 6203.01 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 6203.01 Applicability and Scope. Ins 6203 shall apply to all individual and group ancillary health policies and certificates that provide coverage for accident-only and all group ancillary health policies that provide coverage for specified accident, as applicable, and which are not covered under other rules and are delivered or issued for delivery in this state on and after the initial effective date of this part.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Ins 6200) #12855, eff 8-26-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins6200.html"
